    "body": "Remove the extra Rest button press in a carriage. Start resting automatically as soon as the vanilla rest action becomes valid. Use the game's carriage/rest state or its sanctioned script path; do not press the control every frame. Acceptance: entering an eligible carriage reaches rest without the extra button, ineligible states do nothing, and ordinary carriage controls remain available.",
